---
source: crates/biome_css_analyze/tests/spec_tests.rs
expression: invalid.scss
---
# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
.a {
	@include breakpoint {
		.b {
			.c {
				.d {
					color: red;
				}
			}
		}
	}
}

.a {
	.b {
		@if $x {
			.c {
				.d {
					color: red;
				}
			}
		} @else if $y {
			.c {
				.d {
					color: blue;
				}
			}
		} @else {
			.c {
				.d {
					color: green;
				}
			}
		}
	}
}

.a {
	@each $name in $names {
		.b {
			.c {
				.d {
					color: red;
				}
			}
		}
	}
}

```

# Diagnostics
