  i This block is nested 4 levels deep, but the maximum is 3.
  
    4 │ 		.b {
    5 │ 			.c {
  > 6 │ 				.d {
      │ 				^^
    7 │ 					color: red;
    8 │ 				}
  
  i Deeply nested blocks are hard to read, and each nested rule makes the resulting selector longer and more specific, which makes it harder to override.
  
  i Move this block to a shallower level, or split the nesting into separate rules.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

